{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:56 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:56 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:56 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55cf8cb238c4212e913cf2d49c71ba1e/2026-11/004_6.png\"/><p>今日（14日）下午2時許，警方於長洲調查一宗失蹤人口案件期間，在東灣以北對開石灘發現一名女子，經檢查後證實當場死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，女事主為一名65歲姓梁女子，有情緒病紀錄，她11月11日下午在長洲渡輪碼頭最後露面後便告失蹤，其家人昨日（13日）向警方報案。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:24:10.643991+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:56:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:23.533779+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:38.493778+00:00","content_hash":"02f061ec7ac52f16497f096c8467506665b987dbce6dfa0e7fc9cfdfb2e1cfdc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}